{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftsphincs\/signverify"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"","anchor":""},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Messages are signed by secret keys and signatures are verified by public keys."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Signatures can be deterministic or randomized and optionally a hash of the message can be signed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instead of the message itself."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftSPHINCS","","\/\/ Create the SPHINCS keys","","let (secretKey, publicKey) = SPHINCS.GenerateKeyPair(kind: .SHA2_128f)","","\/\/ Deterministic signature","let deterministicSig = secretKey.Sign(message: [1, 2, 3], randomize: false)","print(\"Deterministic:\", publicKey.Verify(message: [1, 2, 3], signature: deterministicSig))","","\/\/ Randomized signature","let randomizedSig = secretKey.Sign(message: [1, 2, 3], randomize: true)","print(\"Randomized:\", publicKey.Verify(message: [1, 2, 3], signature: randomizedSig))","","\/\/ Pre-hashed signature","let preHashedSig = secretKey.Sign(message: [1, 2, 3], ph: .SHA256)","print(\"Pre-hashed:\", publicKey.Verify(message: [1, 2, 3], signature: preHashedSig, ph: .SHA256))"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"giving:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["Deterministic: true","Randomized: true","Pre-hashed: true"]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftSPHINCS\/documentation\/SwiftSPHINCS\/SignVerify"},"metadata":{"title":"Sign and Verify","modules":[{"name":"SwiftSPHINCS"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftSPHINCS\/documentation\/SwiftSPHINCS\/KeyManagement","doc:\/\/SwiftSPHINCS\/documentation\/SwiftSPHINCS\/OIDs","doc:\/\/SwiftSPHINCS\/documentation\/SwiftSPHINCS\/Performance","doc:\/\/SwiftSPHINCS\/documentation\/SwiftSPHINCS\/References"],"anchor":"Additional-Information","title":"Additional Information"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftSPHINCS\/documentation\/SwiftSPHINCS"]]},"references":{"doc://SwiftSPHINCS/documentation/SwiftSPHINCS/OIDs":{"role":"article","title":"ASN1 OIDs","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiftsphincs\/oids","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftSPHINCS\/documentation\/SwiftSPHINCS\/OIDs"},"doc://SwiftSPHINCS/documentation/SwiftSPHINCS":{"title":"SwiftSPHINCS","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftsphincs","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftSPHINCS\/documentation\/SwiftSPHINCS","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stateless Hash-Based Digital Signature Standard"}]},"doc://SwiftSPHINCS/documentation/SwiftSPHINCS/Performance":{"role":"article","title":"Performance","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiftsphincs\/performance","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftSPHINCS\/documentation\/SwiftSPHINCS\/Performance"},"doc://SwiftSPHINCS/documentation/SwiftSPHINCS/References":{"role":"article","title":"References","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiftsphincs\/references","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftSPHINCS\/documentation\/SwiftSPHINCS\/References"},"doc://SwiftSPHINCS/documentation/SwiftSPHINCS/KeyManagement":{"role":"article","title":"Key Management","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiftsphincs\/keymanagement","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftSPHINCS\/documentation\/SwiftSPHINCS\/KeyManagement"}}}